sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Open-Meteo API
    participant P as producer.py
    participant K as Kafka (weather-stream)
    participant S as Spark Streaming
    participant M as MongoDB
    participant D as Dashboard
    loop every 60 seconds
        P->>API: GET /v1/forecast (5 cities, 7 variables)
        API-->>P: JSON list (one result per city)
        P->>P: flatten → 35 messages
        P->>K: send(key=sensor_id, value=JSON), acks=all
    end
    loop micro-batch every 10 s / 15 s
        S->>K: read new offsets
        S->>S: parse, filter, quality flag
        S->>M: upsert cleaned readings (weather_raw)
        S->>S: 5-min window avg/min/max/std/count
        S->>M: upsert windows (weather_agg_windowed) + heartbeat
    end
    loop every 15 seconds (Live Monitor)
        D->>K: poll new messages
        K-->>D: latest readings
    end
    D->>M: History / Analytics / Export queries
    M-->>D: filtered + aggregated results
